1. Description

    Implemented the Medicine Subscription Management functionality for the Pharma Store, allowing customers to subscribe to regularly required medicines and manage recurring deliveries through a centralized subscription interface.

    The feature was designed for customers who regularly purchase medicines such as diabetes, blood-pressure, heart-care, and other long-term medications. Instead of manually placing the same order repeatedly, customers can configure a subscription and receive their medicines according to a selected schedule.

2. Business Requirement

    Customers who regularly require medicines need a convenient way to automate recurring purchases.

    The subscription system was introduced to allow customers to:

    Subscribe to frequently used medicines.
    Select a delivery frequency.
    Define the required quantity.
    View active subscriptions.
    Monitor upcoming deliveries.
    Manage existing subscriptions.
    Pause or resume subscriptions.
    Skip an upcoming delivery.
    Cancel subscriptions.
    View subscription pricing and savings.

    The objective is to reduce repetitive ordering and provide a convenient recurring-medicine purchasing experience.

3. Features Implemented
    Medicine Subscription

    Customers can create a subscription for an eligible medicine.

    The subscription captures information such as:

    Medicine/product
    Quantity
    Subscription frequency
    Delivery schedule
    Subscription price
    Subscription status
    Next delivery date

    Example:

     Medicine:
     Metformin 500 mg


    Quantity:
     2 packs


    Frequency:
     Every 30 Days


    Next Delivery:
      15 September 2026


    Status:
     Active

4. Subscription Creation Workflow

    The subscription workflow follows:

    Customer opens medicine
           ↓
    Selects subscription option
           ↓
    Selects quantity
           ↓
    Selects delivery frequency
           ↓
    Reviews subscription details
           ↓
    Confirms subscription
           ↓
    Subscription Created
           ↓
    Next Delivery Scheduled

    This provides a simple process for converting a regular medicine purchase into a recurring subscription.

