9. Subscription Management Actions

    Customers can manage existing subscriptions through dedicated actions.

    View Details

    Displays complete subscription information.

    Pause

    Temporarily stops upcoming recurring deliveries without permanently cancelling the subscription.

    Resume

    Restarts a previously paused subscription.

    Skip Next Delivery

    Allows the customer to skip one upcoming delivery while keeping the subscription active.

    Cancel

    Permanently stops the recurring subscription.

